reamy feeling. The center of the flower is denser, and the petals gradually expand outward, forming a sense of layering. There are several leaves around the flower, which are also shiny and have a color that echoes the flower.\n\nThe background is dark, highlighting the bright colors of the flowers, making the flowers appear more prominent and eye-catching. The overall environment seems mysterious and elegant, as if it is in a fantasy world.\n\nStyled, this picture belongs to digital art and has the characteristics of surrealism. It creates a dreamy atmosphere through the use of light, shadow and color. In the emotional atmosphere, this picture gives people a sense of tranquility, elegance and mystery, as if telling a beautiful and mysterious story.\n\nThe light is mainly concentrated on the flowers, making it the focus of the picture, while the surrounding light is softer, creating a warm and soft atmosphere. In terms of color, it mainly focuses on cool tones, but the center part of the flower and the edges of the petals have subtle warm tones, which increases the layering and visual impact of the picture."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 155, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 132, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [148, 154], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [303.59649658203125, 490.8908386230469], "pos": [-487.020751953125, 1061.2083740234375], "widgets_values": ["", "图片的主体是一朵精致的花朵，花瓣呈现出半透明且带有光泽的质感，颜色从淡蓝到浅紫渐变，给人一种梦幻般的感觉。花朵的中心部分较为密集，花瓣则向外逐渐展开，形成一种层次感。花朵周围有几片叶子，同样具有光泽，颜色与花朵相呼应。\n\n背景为深色，突出了花朵的亮丽色彩，使花朵显得更加突出和引人注目。整体环境显得神秘而优雅，仿佛置身于一个奇幻的世界。\n\n风格上，这幅图属于数字艺术，具有超现实主义的特点，通过光影和色彩的运用，营造出一种梦幻般的氛围。情感氛围上，这幅图给人一种宁静、优雅和神秘的感觉，仿佛在诉说着一个美丽而神秘的故事。\n\n光线主要集中在花朵上，使其成为画面的焦点，而周围的光线则较为柔和，营造出一种温暖而柔和的氛围。色彩上，主要以冷色调为主，但花朵的中心部分和花瓣边缘有微妙的暖色调，增加了画面的层次感和视觉冲击力。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 147, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 130, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "size": [210, 76.98245239257812], "pos": [-1426.6846923828125, 715.8836059570312], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 115, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "未来幻想风", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [124, 129], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [128, 132], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [315, 246], "pos": [-356.3022155761719, -71.28690338134766], "widgets_values": ["蔚蓝Blue幻彩动漫二次元_卡通炫彩_1.0.safetensors", 1.0000000000000002, "illustrious_Nai3_v2-18.safetensors", 0, "None", 1, "None", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 123, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 127, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}], "flags": {}, "id": 108, "type": "Lora Loader Stack (rgthree)", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Lora Loader Stack (rgthree)"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "size": [214.0962677001953, 82], "pos": [-1429.690673828125, 580.9873657226562], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 112, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "二次元风格", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [41, 63, 91, 97, 98, 103, 135], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [367.